ntpd-rs: correct a clock that is far off through NTS (what and why: ntpd-rs-wrong-clock.md).
Made against ntpd-rs v1.9.0 (46ec9bb4d5b6cb24f814f5543d85b9138afb4cba). It changes only the
ntp-proto crate: git apply in the source tree, or git apply -p2 in the crate's directory.

